+# Nominal calendar deadline reference review87
+
+Exact unmodified A source at aeac3c8d0321c35d497d2abee39897c978d586ca returned
+send advice at/after the supplied deadline in five NEW focused calls. This
+portable probe is byte-identical to the actual executed snapshot. It requires
+the exact original boot_profile.py, wire.py and boot_profiles.json beside it;
+those bytes and original commands/outputs are archived in this operation's
+raw evidence, with full source hashes. Run only deliberately into a new output
+file using --phase counterexample or --phase adjacent, --doc and --out.
+Counterexample exit4 is intended evidence of the reference guard failure;
+five adjacent controls exit0. Never label the reference deadline guard passed.
+
+Two actual Windows Jobs were suspended-attached before resume and are closed,
+empty and terminal. Main independently compared actual start/deadline integers,
+original source before/after and every raw stream hash without replaying A's
+suite. A owns the source fix; B caller must independently enforce strict
+chosen_start < original_deadline. This does not prove a complete caller-chain
+exploit, real packet/world action, production BOOT or physical-board result.
+
+The later B source/evidence commits assemble the exact handoff and are not
+claimed executed as commits. Original A source/counterexamples remain intact.
+H01-H15/revision1 fixed requirements c229834bfc2292f5fe4411fc9f12c68487008f9d1adaf31f0144ee7a98173804,
+pin f5989cd5defce561f9ba98e6b18fc2682945f0a2 and freeze1011259415a0916054eb580687612580bc1e5f09.
+Default hardware_enable_eligible=false remains; B04/fullH12/formal unaccepted.
+A alone operates physical hardware. No fixed compression-ratio gate is added.
